        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a8"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts15" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts16">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>ni’ st’e ’u kw’ skwulush ni’ ni’’i’ tthu qa’ ’u kw’u hay ’ul’ tsitsulh.
