                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts45" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts46">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>suw’ qwulmut-s tthu mun’us, “’umut, mun’u, ’i ch wulh ’umlhelt.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
